  = note: SCXML 1.0 §3.4.2 allows a `<parallel>` with no `<state>` children, but only atomic states enable transitions (§3.13: "enabled by named event E in atomic state S"), and a `<parallel>` is never atomic (§3.3: "An atomic state is a <state> that has no <state>, <parallel> or <final> children"); while it is active, its own transitions are never taken, its ancestors' only through other active atomic states, and it never raises `done.state`
